(4, 2, 1, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, 'sp-demo-004', 'SP Demo 004', '', '', 1, 200000, 190000, NULL, '<p>CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE &mdash; With five width options, our straps fit most watches and smartwatches. Just make sure to choose the right width for your watch or it WILL NOT FIT. Carefully measure your watch&rsquo;s lug width in mm (see illustration in the pictures section for how to measure), check your watch manufacturer&rsquo;s website for your watch&rsquo;s specs, or see our list of smartwatch widths in the product description below for smartwatches from Fossil, Moto, LG, Pebble, Samsung, Nokia, Withings, and more.</p>', NULL, NULL, 'Fusce lacinia, nunc ac molestie facilisis, est nulla rutrum nisl, at hendrerit orci tortor non lorem. Nunc sit amet nisl id felis congue interdum. Duis id ex vestibulum purus pretium interdum. Cras nec nulla in enim facilisis dignissim. Phasellus tempus ipsum nibh, nec aliquet orci suscipit sit amet.', '', '<p>Embodying the raw, wayward spirit of rock &lsquo;n&rsquo; roll, the Kilburn portable active stereo speaker takes the unmistakable look and sound of Marshall, unplugs the chords, and takes the show on the road.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weighing in under 7 pounds, the Kilburn is a lightweight piece of vintage styled engineering. Setting the bar as one of the loudest speakers in its class, the Kilburn is a compact, stout-hearted hero with a well-balanced audio which boasts a clear midrange and extended highs for a sound that is both articulate and pronounced. The analogue knobs allow you to fine tune the controls to your personal preferences while the guitar-influenced leather strap enables easy and stylish travel.</p>\r\n', '500x500_20240205034010.png', NULL, 'resize_500x500_20240205034010.png', 0, '', NULL, 1, NULL, 1, 0, NULL, 1, '2024-02-05', '2024-02-05', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mới 99%', 'German', 'Đồng hồ điện tử', 'Hướng dẫn in trên bao bì', '6 tháng', 'N/A', 'Đài Loan', '<table class=\"woocommerce-product-